// Metabind project settings — the client-writable projection of `metabind project get`.
// Prose fields are files: ./mcp-instructions.md (settings.mcp.instructions),
// ./agent/system-prompt.md (settings.agent.systemPrompt).
// Server-stamped fields (id, timestamps, mcpUrl, publish version) live in .metabind/state.json.
// Fields outside this file (permissions, …) are web-administered — push never touches them.
// `thumbnail` references an asset in ./assets/files by name; sync resolves it.
